isting, Flipping, Rolling, Crashing &amp; Damage, Pre-Race Setup, Instant Replays, Full Controller Support, Steam Controller Support, Character Creation/Selection, Local/LAN Multiplayer, Steam Leaderboards, Steam Achievements, VR Support, Support for Race Wheels.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100650/extras/49b83878d55a5d8a2ac74adc925cc66f.webp?t=1744183084\" /></div><br>Join Discord\u00ae or send us your email on the website and get a free Beta Key to start testing and providing feedback right now. Be the first to learn about release dates, news, contests, future DLC, and more.",
